{"title":"Frost Giant Brute","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 24 Hill Giant that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/giants-knucklebone\">Giants Knucklebone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-giant-brute\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/frost-giant-brute?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>6</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/frost-giant-brute?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>6</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/frost-giant-brute?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>6</td><td>in the wilds around -276, -958</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/frost-giant-brute\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>25</b></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td>6</td><td>in the wilds around -216, -924</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"frost-giant-brute\" data-map-level=\"25\">Show level 25 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-945.2px,819.4px)\"><i style=\"left:979.0px;top:-807.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:925.4px;top:-848.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:928.1px;top:-774.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1010.7px;top:-792.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:877.3px;top:-910.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1013.3px;top:-787.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:948.3px;top:-847.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:933.7px;top:-774.1px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -253, -940 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -213, -930 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -344, -982 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"frost-giant-brute\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Hill Giant: <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth\">Hill Giant Youth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(13)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-adolescent\">Hill Giant Adolescent</a> <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-titan\">Hill Giant Titan</a> <span class=\"muted\">(18)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/frost-giant\">Frost Giant</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-behemoth\">Hill Giant Behemoth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/frost-giant-chieftain\">Frost 